WEBVTT

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:08.318
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:11.890
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.949
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:18.923
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.499 --> 00:00:23.335
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:25.462
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:30.265
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.977 --> 00:00:34.747
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.747 --> 00:00:37.375
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.649 --> 00:00:41.244
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.688 --> 00:00:47.352
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.862
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.862 --> 00:00:53.059
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.069
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.069 --> 00:01:01.130
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.373 --> 00:01:06.003
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.270
Let's go!

00:01:12.551 --> 00:01:15.987
THE LONGEST DAY IN SPACE

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:35.300
Lieutenant Commander Tylor has
now been given special command.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:42.212
People! Our enemy, the Raalgon,
have foolishly penetrated...

00:01:42.281 --> 00:01:45.773
...our final defense line and
launched an all-out attack!

00:01:45.984 --> 00:01:47.713
But we've nothing to fear!

00:01:48.687 --> 00:01:52.191
We in the high command have
given Tylor, who is familiar...

00:01:52.191 --> 00:01:55.354
...with the enemy flagship Melva,
command of all our forces!

00:01:55.828 --> 00:01:59.764
Captain Tylor has personally
assured me that we will not lose!

00:02:00.499 --> 00:02:03.268
It is also decided that,
due to his lack of experience...

00:02:03.268 --> 00:02:06.863
...I and Admiral Mifune shall join
him aboard the destroyer Soyokaze.

00:02:07.406 --> 00:02:11.510
Many of you are unsure
of Captain Tylor's abilities...

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:14.502
...but have no fear! Fight the
enemy with all your strength!

00:02:16.014 --> 00:02:19.814
Don't fear death! Triumph!
Those are my orders to you!

00:02:21.653 --> 00:02:25.521
Tylor... This is the last chance
you'll have to look so calm.

00:02:29.495 --> 00:02:31.895
Wha- What did you say?!
Is that true?!

00:02:32.231 --> 00:02:36.861
Most definitely. According to
the report, we've learned that...

00:02:36.935 --> 00:02:41.463
...their commander is our
former prisoner, Justy Ueki Tylor.

00:02:41.607 --> 00:02:42.835
It can't be...

00:02:43.575 --> 00:02:44.803
It's Tylor?

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:53.844
If we win,
then my influence...

00:02:53.919 --> 00:02:56.888
...as this war's chief
proponent will rise.

00:02:56.955 --> 00:02:59.890
If we lose, the empress
will be held responsible...

00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:02.893
...and her power
will be diminished.

00:03:02.961 --> 00:03:07.125
Either way, I will
have the last laugh.

00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:11.093
I never expected them to make
Paco-Paco their commander!

00:03:39.531 --> 00:03:42.989
Why, Dom? Why have you requested
that you command our forces?

00:03:45.103 --> 00:03:46.627
Why won't you answer me?!

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:51.136
Dom, don't you understand
what I'm asking you?

00:03:52.744 --> 00:03:55.542
Is it because you want
to kill Paco-Paco?!

00:04:00.185 --> 00:04:05.020
Answer me, Dom! Answer me,
or I cannot grant your request!

00:04:07.893 --> 00:04:09.053
Won't you answer?

00:04:10.329 --> 00:04:14.493
Highness, for your sake,
for our empire's sake...

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:16.960
...I am prepared to kill Tylor!

00:04:18.237 --> 00:04:20.137
You would kill Paco-Paco?!

00:04:26.778 --> 00:04:27.972
The captain's gone?!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.147
He wasn't at the meeting.
He's not in his room.

00:04:31.383 --> 00:04:33.510
He's not here. Which means...

00:04:33.986 --> 00:04:37.012
You don't suppose he couldn't
take the pressure of command...

00:04:37.456 --> 00:04:38.718
...and he's hiding somewhere?

00:04:38.857 --> 00:04:40.484
No... He wouldn't...

00:04:54.239 --> 00:04:55.729
All boosters, nominal!

00:04:56.074 --> 00:04:58.201
Thruster engine firing, nominal!

00:04:58.543 --> 00:05:00.443
Liquid oxygen tanks, nominal!

00:05:00.746 --> 00:05:02.441
Power and oil pressure
servos, nominal!

00:05:02.781 --> 00:05:05.215
Manual-Auto switching
systems, nominal!

00:05:05.751 --> 00:05:08.276
That's it.
All sections, nominal.

00:05:08.553 --> 00:05:11.613
Okay, you two, into the
cockpits for our final checks.

00:05:11.957 --> 00:05:13.720
Yes, sir! Understood.

00:05:14.192 --> 00:05:15.352
Oh, Captain!

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:25.529
Our first big fight in a while.
Let's really cut loose, guys!

00:05:30.342 --> 00:05:31.206
Captain.

00:05:40.052 --> 00:05:44.045
We can prepare, but we don't know
when they'll need us to work.

00:05:44.122 --> 00:05:45.612
Get things ready, Harumi.

00:05:46.124 --> 00:05:46.647
Yes, sir.

00:05:47.726 --> 00:05:49.159
Something wrong, Captain?

00:05:55.767 --> 00:05:56.791
Sorry I'm late!

00:05:57.869 --> 00:05:59.996
Captain!
Where have you been?!

00:06:00.238 --> 00:06:02.297
Didn't you go to the
strategy meeting?

00:06:02.641 --> 00:06:03.505
Captain!

00:06:07.946 --> 00:06:09.777
Well, shall we get going?

00:06:10.982 --> 00:06:11.744
Captain...

00:06:14.886 --> 00:06:18.982
Enemy fleet, sighted! Presence of
enemy super battleship, confirmed!

00:06:19.658 --> 00:06:21.649
Captain Tylor! Where is he?!

00:06:22.794 --> 00:06:23.726
Right over here!

00:06:24.162 --> 00:06:27.097
Damn it, you knew there
was a strategy session!

00:06:27.165 --> 00:06:28.826
Are you trying
to make fools of us?!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.900
I'm not making
a fool of anybody.

00:06:31.103 --> 00:06:33.094
Unnecessary stress
is bad for your health.

00:06:33.605 --> 00:06:35.835
Just leave everything to me.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:44.011
Silence!
Silence, all of you!

00:06:46.118 --> 00:06:50.077
Goza the 16th, Empress of the Holy
Raalgon Empire, now commands you.

00:06:50.522 --> 00:06:53.047
The cruiser Doroume
is to be our flagship...

00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:57.323
...and Captain Ru Baraba Dom
is given command of the fleet.

00:06:58.063 --> 00:06:59.931
Highness, wait a moment.

00:06:59.931 --> 00:07:00.659
No.

00:07:00.732 --> 00:07:01.867
B- But!

00:07:01.867 --> 00:07:03.698
I said no!
The decision is made!

00:07:07.873 --> 00:07:08.430
Dom!

00:07:09.808 --> 00:07:10.536
Go to it.

00:07:11.777 --> 00:07:12.334
Aye.

00:07:31.062 --> 00:07:34.327
The Melva and its defense
fleet will hold here.

00:07:34.566 --> 00:07:36.761
All other vessels,
fall in with the Doroume!

00:08:12.504 --> 00:08:15.200
The carrier Ho-Oh and
its defense fleet will hold here.

00:08:15.273 --> 00:08:16.570
All other ships, move out!

00:08:17.142 --> 00:08:19.872
Carrier Ho-Oh and its
defense fleet, hold here.

00:08:19.945 --> 00:08:20.969
All other ships, move out!

00:08:36.595 --> 00:08:40.799
Highness, if anything should
happen, you'll be in danger here.

00:08:40.799 --> 00:08:42.494
Perhaps you should
go to the shelter chamber?

00:08:42.667 --> 00:08:46.000
No, I shall remain here.
I wish to see everything.

00:08:46.838 --> 00:08:47.566
Aye.

00:08:47.873 --> 00:08:53.812
Then see with your own eyes the
moment I gain my new power.

00:08:57.315 --> 00:08:59.715
1-5-0-0 to battle zone.

00:09:13.832 --> 00:09:17.131
We and the enemy fleet will
enter the battle zone shortly.

00:09:18.003 --> 00:09:21.803
All ships, assume a spindle
formation and full speed ahead.

00:09:46.765 --> 00:09:48.630
To all ships, immediate...

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:51.328
All ships, full speed ahead!

00:09:54.639 --> 00:09:56.539
Now entering battle zone.

00:09:57.676 --> 00:09:58.472
Captain Dom!

00:10:10.956 --> 00:10:12.787
We have entered the battle zone!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.591
Captain Tylor!

00:10:16.828 --> 00:10:17.988
What are your instructions?!

00:10:18.229 --> 00:10:19.127
Captain!

00:10:19.965 --> 00:10:21.159
Losing your nerve?!

00:10:21.633 --> 00:10:24.830
Don't forget, you promised
us that we wouldn't lose!

00:10:25.036 --> 00:10:25.627
Captain!

00:10:25.737 --> 00:10:26.965
Give the next order!

00:10:31.476 --> 00:10:33.171
Captain Dom,
give the next order!

00:10:34.212 --> 00:10:36.180
All ships, continue to advance.

00:10:36.648 --> 00:10:37.979
Continue to advance!

00:10:38.516 --> 00:10:39.505
What?!

00:10:39.818 --> 00:10:41.547
Wh- What are you doing?!

00:11:31.069 --> 00:11:33.663
Captain, any closer to
them will be dangerous!

00:11:34.072 --> 00:11:37.235
T- Tylor, why won't you
give the order to attack?!

00:11:37.475 --> 00:11:38.237
Tylor!

00:11:38.476 --> 00:11:39.943
C- Captain!

00:11:40.278 --> 00:11:41.745
Why won't you say something?!

00:11:45.316 --> 00:11:47.045
Captain Dom, order the attack!

00:11:50.255 --> 00:11:50.983
Captain Dom!

00:11:51.823 --> 00:11:52.881
Just wait.

00:11:59.864 --> 00:12:01.627
Captain, order the attack!

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:02.591
Captain!

00:12:02.734 --> 00:12:06.261
Damn it, if you don't have a plan,
then give up command this instant!

00:12:06.604 --> 00:12:08.697
I agree with Admiral Mifune!

00:12:09.474 --> 00:12:10.839
To all ships!

00:12:11.309 --> 00:12:11.798
Yes, sir!

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:13.504
Continue to advance!

00:12:32.664 --> 00:12:34.632
Captain Dom, do we still wait?!

00:13:01.826 --> 00:13:04.693
Wh- What's that light?!
What's happening?!

00:13:04.896 --> 00:13:07.990
We're so close to each other
that the electrical charge...

00:13:08.066 --> 00:13:10.864
...of all the ships
is saturating the area!

00:13:11.402 --> 00:13:12.426
Saturating the area?

00:13:25.917 --> 00:13:26.884
Tylor...

00:14:06.991 --> 00:14:08.219
Order the attack!

00:14:08.626 --> 00:14:09.320
Not yet!

00:14:10.395 --> 00:14:11.191
Captain Dom?

00:14:11.596 --> 00:14:15.862
Shia Has, don't you see his plan?
It's still too soon.

00:14:16.167 --> 00:14:17.361
His plan?

00:14:17.535 --> 00:14:21.096
Exactly.
This is all Tylor's plan.

00:14:55.306 --> 00:14:56.671
C- Captain!

00:15:00.011 --> 00:15:03.003
What does the captain
have in mind?!

00:15:29.641 --> 00:15:31.165
Tylor!!!

00:16:03.207 --> 00:16:05.300
The captain's smiling!
Can that be it?!

00:16:06.911 --> 00:16:08.037
Sorry I'm late!

00:16:08.713 --> 00:16:09.907
That smile...

00:16:11.416 --> 00:16:12.713
Sorry I'm late!

00:16:13.084 --> 00:16:14.711
That smile he had!

00:16:18.022 --> 00:16:19.387
The way he's acting!

00:16:29.033 --> 00:16:30.523
Admiral Mifune, please!

00:16:30.768 --> 00:16:32.668
Let me go! Let me go!

00:16:35.506 --> 00:16:37.303
Get a hold of yourself, sir!

00:16:40.178 --> 00:16:43.079
The captain must
not be disturbed!

00:16:47.952 --> 00:16:50.785
I can't tell!
I can't tell what he's planning!

00:16:51.456 --> 00:16:52.582
Tylor!

00:16:53.458 --> 00:16:54.186
Captain Dom?

00:16:54.359 --> 00:16:55.121
Shut up!

00:16:57.428 --> 00:16:58.156
Captain!

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:34.082
Captain...

00:18:34.725 --> 00:18:35.589
Captain Dom...

00:18:37.261 --> 00:18:38.250
Tylor...

00:19:43.694 --> 00:19:44.956
Captain!

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.032
Captain!

00:19:53.538 --> 00:19:54.232
Captain!

00:19:54.772 --> 00:19:55.568
Captain!

00:19:56.007 --> 00:19:56.701
Captain!

00:20:01.145 --> 00:20:02.578
I need a drink.

00:20:02.847 --> 00:20:04.678
Captain, try to get up.

00:20:05.149 --> 00:20:06.013
Captain!

00:20:18.462 --> 00:20:20.828
Captain, there's a
message for you, sir.

00:20:21.499 --> 00:20:24.263
A message? Read it, would you?

00:20:24.535 --> 00:20:27.171
Yes, sir. "To the United
Planets Space Force...

00:20:27.171 --> 00:20:29.605
"...and the Raalgon
Imperial Forces."

00:20:29.874 --> 00:20:31.933
"I commend both sides for
emerging victorious."

00:20:32.143 --> 00:20:35.704
"Signed, Admiral Robert J. Hanner,
United Planets Space Force, retired."

00:20:36.581 --> 00:20:38.071
Admiral Hanner?!

00:20:39.116 --> 00:20:41.209
"I commend both sides for
emerging victorious."

00:20:42.353 --> 00:20:44.719
I am truly happy
to hear those words.

00:20:45.389 --> 00:20:48.517
This should finally calm
down all of our admirals.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:50.588
Dom...

00:20:51.295 --> 00:20:51.852
Yes?

00:20:52.163 --> 00:20:56.190
I'm really glad I was able to
believe what you said before.

00:21:01.606 --> 00:21:03.665
Why? Tell me why, Dom!

00:21:04.508 --> 00:21:10.413
Highness, I don't want command
because I want to kill Tylor.

00:21:10.615 --> 00:21:11.343
What?

00:21:11.682 --> 00:21:14.014
I trust Tylor.

00:21:15.553 --> 00:21:18.078
If he really is the
man I think he is...

00:21:18.289 --> 00:21:20.280
If he is a true commander...

00:21:20.524 --> 00:21:23.357
...then this war will
be ended without bloodshed.

00:21:24.795 --> 00:21:29.892
So, it seems Paco-Paco is
the man you thought he was.

00:21:30.601 --> 00:21:33.661
No... The truth is that,
for the first time...

00:21:33.804 --> 00:21:36.830
...I knew the fear
that other soldiers feel.

00:21:37.608 --> 00:21:40.133
For Tylor truly is
an extraordinary man.

00:22:12.943 --> 00:22:13.932
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:15.646 --> 00:22:18.672
"Always be happily irresponsible."
That's Tylor's motto.

00:22:18.983 --> 00:22:21.349
But an angry captain
is a man to be feared.

00:22:21.485 --> 00:22:24.477
Next time, "Snap! Snap!
Crackle! Snap!"

00:22:24.655 --> 00:22:25.485
Watch for it.

00:22:25.856 --> 00:22:27.721
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound

00:22:39.003 --> 00:22:42.106
All he has to do is just...
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:42.106 --> 00:22:45.200
...walk around downtown.
Machi o Aitsu ga Aruiteru dake de

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:49.180
He's a playful man who catches...
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:49.180 --> 00:22:52.013
...the eyes of all who he meets.
Nandemo Ki o Hiku Ochame na Yatsu sa

00:22:52.516 --> 00:22:55.353
Oh! That's why, you see...
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:55.353 --> 00:22:59.153
...he'll be our hero from now on.
Aa, Dakara sa Sou Kore kara Shuyaku

00:22:59.957 --> 00:23:02.326
So, let's begin...
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:02.326 --> 00:23:06.160
...the countdown for the change!
Henshin Byouyomi o Shite yo!

00:23:09.633 --> 00:23:12.431
Take a deep breath, and one two.
12345 Ikizugi o One Two

00:23:13.571 --> 00:23:15.906
Now stride out...
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:15.906 --> 00:23:19.069
...with your head held high.
Saa Kore kara Kuridasou

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:22.941
Downtown Dance
